# XORAS line-ending contract: byte stability for hash-pinned receipts and
# deterministic builds on every platform (Windows runners otherwise apply
# core.autocrlf on checkout, breaking sha256 pin verification).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.dylib binary
*.wasm binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.m4a binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.gguf binary
